Package: gmsvar
Type: Package
Title: Graphical Modelling and DAG Recovery for Structural Vector Autoregressions
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Marco", "Reale", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "marco.reale@canterbury.ac.nz"),
             person("Anna", "Lin", role = "aut"),
             person("Granville", "Tunnicliffe Wilson", role = "aut"),
             person("Chris", "Price", role = "aut"),
             person("Blair", "Robertson", role = "aut"))
Description: Selects the lag order of a vector autoregression by information criteria, estimates the conditional
    independence graph of the window of current and lagged variables from partial-correlation tests or penalised
    screens, and recovers a directed acyclic graph for the contemporaneous structure by a BIC search over orderings
    (exact for small systems, heuristic for larger ones). Includes tools for simulating sparse structural VARs and
    scoring estimated graphs.
